{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, move to it, take it. Check properties. Perform task. If not found, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectLocated    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
